<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="box-model-properties">
    <title>Box model properties</title>
    <shortdesc>This table lists the box model properties described in <xref keyref="ch-box-sizing">Box sizing, margins and padding</xref>. A length is a number with a unit, such as <codeph>12pt</codeph> or <codeph>1em</codeph>. Margin and padding percentages are relative to the containing block’s logical width, or inline size.</shortdesc>
    <refbody>
        <section>
            <!-- TODO: fill the Default cells and describe how each property affects layout in the PDF -->
            <p>These properties set the margins, padding and box sizing of the boxes of a document.</p>
            <p>The CSS-wide keywords <codeph>inherit</codeph>, <codeph>initial</codeph>, <codeph>revert</codeph>, <codeph>revert-layer</codeph>, and <codeph>unset</codeph> can also be used with these properties.</p>
        </section>
        <table id="box-model-properties__I_1g_">
            <tgroup cols="5">
                <thead>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry align="center">Name</entry>
                        <entry align="center">Description</entry>
                        <entry align="center">Values</entry>
                        <entry align="center">Default</entry>
                        <entry align="center">Specification</entry>
                    </row>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>box-sizing</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Chooses whether <codeph>width</codeph> and <codeph>height</codeph> measure the content area or the box including padding and border.</entry>
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>content-box</codeph> measures the content; <codeph>border-box</codeph> includes padding and border.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-sizing-3/#propdef-box-sizing" scope="external" format="html">CSS Sizing 3</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row id="row-margin" valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>margin</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the space outside all four sides of a box.</entry>
                        <entry>One to four lengths or percentages, <codeph>auto</codeph>, or <codeph>anchor-size()</codeph>.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-box-4/#propdef-margin" scope="external" format="html">CSS Box Model 4</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>margin-block</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the margins at the start and end of the block axis.</entry>
                        <entry>One or two lengths, percentages, <codeph>auto</codeph>, or <codeph>anchor-size()</codeph> values.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-logical-1/#propdef-margin-block" scope="external" format="html">CSS Logical Properties 1</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>margin-block-end</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the margin at the end of the block axis.</entry>
                        <entry>Length, percentage, <codeph>auto</codeph>, or <codeph>anchor-size()</codeph>.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-logical-1/#propdef-margin-block-end" scope="external" format="html">CSS Logical Properties 1</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>margin-block-start</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the margin at the start of the block axis.</entry>
                        <entry>Length, percentage, <codeph>auto</codeph>, or <codeph>anchor-size()</codeph>.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-logical-1/#propdef-margin-block-start" scope="external" format="html">CSS Logical Properties 1</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row id="row-margin-bottom" valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>margin-bottom</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the space outside the bottom side of a box.</entry>
                        <entry>Length, percentage, <codeph>auto</codeph>, or <codeph>anchor-size()</codeph>.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-box-4/#propdef-margin-bottom" scope="external" format="html">CSS Box Model 4</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>margin-break</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Controls whether a margin is kept or discarded when its box is split by a page break.</entry>
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>auto</codeph> follows the break rules; <codeph>keep</codeph> keeps the margin; <codeph>discard</codeph> removes it.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-break-4/#propdef-margin-break" scope="external" format="html">CSS Fragmentation 4</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>margin-inline</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the margins at the start and end of the inline axis.</entry>
                        <entry>One or two lengths, percentages, <codeph>auto</codeph>, or <codeph>anchor-size()</codeph> values.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-logical-1/#propdef-margin-inline" scope="external" format="html">CSS Logical Properties 1</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>margin-inline-end</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the margin at the end of the inline axis.</entry>
                        <entry>Length, percentage, <codeph>auto</codeph>, or <codeph>anchor-size()</codeph>.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-logical-1/#propdef-margin-inline-end" scope="external" format="html">CSS Logical Properties 1</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>margin-inline-start</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the margin at the start of the inline axis.</entry>
                        <entry>Length, percentage, <codeph>auto</codeph>, or <codeph>anchor-size()</codeph>.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-logical-1/#propdef-margin-inline-start" scope="external" format="html">CSS Logical Properties 1</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row id="row-margin-left" valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>margin-left</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the space outside the left side of a box.</entry>
                        <entry>Length, percentage, <codeph>auto</codeph>, or <codeph>anchor-size()</codeph>.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-box-4/#propdef-margin-left" scope="external" format="html">CSS Box Model 4</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row id="row-margin-right" valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>margin-right</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the space outside the right side of a box.</entry>
                        <entry>Length, percentage, <codeph>auto</codeph>, or <codeph>anchor-size()</codeph>.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-box-4/#propdef-margin-right" scope="external" format="html">CSS Box Model 4</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row id="row-margin-top" valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>margin-top</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the space outside the top side of a box.</entry>
                        <entry>Length, percentage, <codeph>auto</codeph>, or <codeph>anchor-size()</codeph>.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-box-4/#propdef-margin-top" scope="external" format="html">CSS Box Model 4</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>margin-trim</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Removes selected margins where child boxes meet the edges of their container.</entry>
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>none</codeph>; <codeph>block</codeph>, <codeph>inline</codeph>, or both; or one or more of <codeph>block-start</codeph>, <codeph>inline-start</codeph>, <codeph>block-end</codeph>, and <codeph>inline-end</codeph>.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-box-4/#propdef-margin-trim" scope="external" format="html">CSS Box Model 4</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>padding</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the space between the content and all four sides of its border.</entry>
                        <entry>One to four non-negative lengths or percentages.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-box-4/#propdef-padding" scope="external" format="html">CSS Box Model 4</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>padding-block</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the padding at the start and end of the block axis.</entry>
                        <entry>One or two non-negative lengths or percentages.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-logical-1/#propdef-padding-block" scope="external" format="html">CSS Logical Properties 1</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>padding-block-end</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the padding at the end of the block axis.</entry>
                        <entry>Non-negative length or percentage.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-logical-1/#propdef-padding-block-end" scope="external" format="html">CSS Logical Properties 1</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>padding-block-start</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the padding at the start of the block axis.</entry>
                        <entry>Non-negative length or percentage.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-logical-1/#propdef-padding-block-start" scope="external" format="html">CSS Logical Properties 1</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>padding-bottom</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the space between the content and the bottom border.</entry>
                        <entry>Non-negative length or percentage.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-box-4/#propdef-padding-bottom" scope="external" format="html">CSS Box Model 4</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>padding-inline</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the padding at the start and end of the inline axis.</entry>
                        <entry>One or two non-negative lengths or percentages.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-logical-1/#propdef-padding-inline" scope="external" format="html">CSS Logical Properties 1</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>padding-inline-end</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the padding at the end of the inline axis.</entry>
                        <entry>Non-negative length or percentage.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-logical-1/#propdef-padding-inline-end" scope="external" format="html">CSS Logical Properties 1</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>padding-inline-start</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the padding at the start of the inline axis.</entry>
                        <entry>Non-negative length or percentage.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-logical-1/#propdef-padding-inline-start" scope="external" format="html">CSS Logical Properties 1</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>padding-left</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the space between the content and the left border.</entry>
                        <entry>Non-negative length or percentage.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-box-4/#propdef-padding-left" scope="external" format="html">CSS Box Model 4</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>padding-right</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the space between the content and the right border.</entry>
                        <entry>Non-negative length or percentage.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-box-4/#propdef-padding-right" scope="external" format="html">CSS Box Model 4</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row valign="middle">
                        <entry>
                            <codeph>padding-top</codeph>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>Sets the space between the content and the top border.</entry>
                        <entry>Non-negative length or percentage.</entry>
                        <entry />
                        <entry>
                            <xref href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-box-4/#propdef-padding-top" scope="external" format="html">CSS Box Model 4</xref>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                </tbody>
            </tgroup>
        </table>
    </refbody>
</reference>

